2.  Implementation: I refactored the process_image bash function inside the fips-operator-check-step-action.yaml manifest by introducing a handle_process_result helper that handles logging, cleans up OCI artifacts, and reliably manages concurrent counter file updates. I committed this as a logical change according to your Git commit guidelines.
